### Product Summary

SQUADLINK is a web-based local commerce and last-mile delivery coordination platform connecting customers with registered local businesses and independent delivery operators in Bauchi State.

Customers can browse a unified product catalogue and build orders from available products. Before an order is finalized and payment is completed, SQUADLINK verifies that a single registered business can fulfill the complete order based on product availability, quantity, pricing, and business status.

Once a suitable business is confirmed, SQUADLINK coordinates an independent rider, using a motorcycle or Keke NAPEP, to collect and deliver the order. Pickup-code and delivery-OTP verification provide accountability throughout the fulfillment process.

SQUADLINK does not own participating businesses and does not operate its own delivery fleet. Instead, it functions as a digital coordination layer connecting customers, local businesses, and independent delivery operators.

