# 3. Product Goal & Objectives

## 3.1 Product Goal

To provide a simple digital channel through which customers in Bauchi can order products from local businesses with confidence that the complete order can be fulfilled, while enabling independent riders to be coordinated to complete verified pickup and delivery.

## 3.2 Project Objectives

| ID     | Objective                                                                                    | How Completion Will Be Gauged                                                                                |
