| **01** | Enable customers to browse the catalogue, build an order, and complete a simulated checkout. | A test customer can select products, enter a delivery location, and complete a sandbox payment.              |
| **02** | Verify that a single business can fulfill the complete order before payment is finalized.    | The Fulfillment Engine selects one eligible business or returns a clear `NO_BUSINESS_FOUND` result.          |
| **03** | Coordinate an available motorcycle or Keke NAPEP rider to collect and deliver the order.     | The Dispatch Engine assigns a suitable rider who can accept or decline the delivery.                         |
