## 4.1 Primary Persona

**Musa, 24**, lives in Bauchi and frequently needs household items and drinks delivered while he is at work.

Musa wants to:

* Search nearby businesses.
* Confirm that products are actually available before paying.
* Place an order without making a physical trip.
* Know when the business has prepared and released the order.
* Know when the rider has picked up the order.
