# 5. Value Proposition & Significance

SQUADLINK is not simply a digital order form. It structures the complete local-delivery loop so that fulfillment is verified before payment, delivery is verified at both ends, and participants have visibility into the process.

### For Customers

* Confidence that the complete order can be fulfilled.
* Access to local products through a unified catalogue.
* Visibility into order progress.
* Verified delivery completion.

### For Businesses

* A digital demand channel.
* A structured catalogue.
* Orders based on actual product availability.
* Reduced manual coordination with riders and customers.

### For Riders

* Access to organized delivery opportunities.
* Ability to use existing motorcycle or Keke NAPEP capacity.
* Clear pickup and delivery verification.
* Recorded delivery earnings.

### For SquadLabs

* A demonstrable end-to-end coordination platform.
* A practical demonstration of the underlying business mechanism.
* A foundation that can later support more advanced commerce and logistics capabilities.

