The MVP is the smallest credible version of SQUADLINK capable of demonstrating the complete coordination loop:

**Catalogue-Based Ordering → Complete-Order Business Verification → Payment → Fulfillment → Dispatch → Verified Pickup → Verified Delivery → Settlement Recording**

| Priority         | Included                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         | Hackathon Decision                         |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |
| **Must**         | Customer registration/login, catalogue browsing, cart, delivery location, sandbox checkout, single-business fulfillment verification, alternative-business fallback, business catalogue management, rider registration/availability, motorcycle/Keke dispatch, pickup code, delivery OTP, order-status tracking, admin monitoring/exception handling, RBAC, audit logging, and input validation. | Build and test first.                      |
| **Should**       | In-app/web notifications for major status changes, English/Hausa localization provision, and basic 3D-generated visual assets for product/demo presentation.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     | Build after Must features are stable.      |
