# 12. Acceptance Criteria & Success Metrics

| Objective / Area          | MVP Acceptance Criterion                                                              | Pass Condition                                                                            |
| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Ordering & Checkout**   | Customer can browse products, place an order, and complete a sandbox payment.         | Order reaches `PAYMENT_VERIFIED` with correct totals.                                     |
| **Fulfillment**           | A single eligible business is verified before payment is finalized.                   | Fulfillment Engine returns one eligible business or a clear `NO_BUSINESS_FOUND` result.   |
| **Dispatch**              | A suitable available motorcycle or Keke rider is matched and can accept the delivery. | Delivery reaches `RIDER_ACCEPTED` with a suitable rider.                                  |
| **Pickup Verification**   | Business verifies the pickup code before releasing the order.                         | Order reaches `PICKUP_VERIFIED` only after successful code verification.                  |
| **Delivery Verification** | Rider verifies the delivery OTP.                                                      | Order reaches `COMPLETED` only after correct OTP verification.                            |
| **Settlement**            | Business and rider settlement amounts are recorded in the ledger.                     | Ledger displays eligible/pending entries after successful completion.                     |
| **Exception Handling**    | At least one controlled exception is demonstrated end-to-end.                         | Rider decline or item-unavailable scenario resolves without manual database intervention. |

